# sokol-shdc prebuilts (sokol_shaders.cmake + bin/<host>/sokol-shdc).
# The pinned commit must be bumped TOGETHER with the vendored
# third_party_libs/sokol/sokol_gfx.h: the generated shader headers carry a
# generator tag and static bind-slot defines tied to that header revision.
# See docs/architecture/specs/2026-09-11-sokol-gfx-backend.md §1.1.
# shallow: the upstream history is several GB of binary prebuilts; only the
# pinned snapshot is needed.
[submodule "third_party_libs/sokol-tools-bin"]
	path = third_party_libs/sokol-tools-bin
	url = https://github.com/floooh/sokol-tools-bin.git
	shallow = true
